---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { url } from '../consts';
---
<BaseLayout wide hero title="Ventures" path="/ventures" description="What Joe Neiman has built and what he's buying now: ACV Auctions, DealerClub, franchise dealerships, and airplanes.">
  <div class="hero-full page-hero full-bleed">
    <img src={url('/assets/photos/avanti.jpg')} alt="Piaggio Avanti P180 in a hangar" width="1600" height="1200" loading="eager" />
    <div class="hero-overlay"><span class="eyebrow">Joe Neiman</span><h1>Ventures</h1></div>
  </div>

  <!-- built: each venture as a designed row, sides alternating -->
  <div class="venture-row" data-rise>
    <figure class="vr-media duotone-media">
      <img src={url('/assets/photos/ipo-day-nasdaq.jpg')} alt="Joe Neiman at the Nasdaq podium on ACV's IPO day" width="568" height="696" loading="lazy" />
    </figure>
    <div>
      <span class="vr-kicker">Built</span>
      <h2>ACV Auctions</h2>
      <p>
        I co-founded ACV in Buffalo in 2015 and spent eight years growing it, from
        three cofounders to over 2,000 teammates, through approximately $300
        million of venture capital, to a Nasdaq IPO in March of 2021 at a
        valuation over $5 billion.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="venture-row flip" data-rise>
    <figure class="vr-media duotone-media">
      <img src={url('/assets/photos/nada-cars-commerce.jpg')} alt="Joe Neiman and the team at the NADA Show announcement that DealerClub is now part of Cars Commerce" width="1600" height="1200" loading="lazy" />
    </figure>
    <div>
      <span class="vr-kicker">Built</span>
      <h2>DealerClub</h2>
      <p>
        In 2023 I started again with DealerClub, the wholesale auction rebuilt
        around reputation, and funded it myself. Cars Commerce acquired it three
        months after we went live commercially.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="venture-row" data-rise>
    <figure class="vr-media duotone-media">
      <img src={url('/assets/photos/joe-headshot-brick.jpg')} alt="Joe Neiman headshot against a brick wall" width="754" height="754" loading="lazy" />
    </figure>
    <div>
      <span class="vr-kicker">Before all of that</span>
      <h2>In Demand Auto</h2>
      <p>
        My first real business was a used car dealership in Albany. We leased a
        former Chevy dealership facility, sold 40-plus cars per month, and were a
        top rated seller on eBay years before buying a car online was normal.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="venture-row flip" data-rise>
    <figure class="vr-media duotone-media">
      <img src={url('/assets/photos/cessna-ttx.jpg')} alt="Joe Neiman on the ramp with a Cessna TTx" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" />
    </figure>
    <div>
      <span class="vr-kicker">Next</span>
      <h2>Buying now</h2>
      <p>
        I'm looking to build a portfolio of franchise car dealerships because I believe
        in the resiliency of the US auto industry and the overall dependency and cultural
        stronghold that automobiles provide. I also buy and sell airplanes for fun.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- closer: the ask -->
  <section class="band band-light closer-band full-bleed" data-rise>
    <div class="band-inner">
      <span class="eyebrow">Interested in</span>
      <ul class="list-ruled" style="text-align: left;">
        <li>Franchise car dealerships: buying, selling, and brokering.</li>
        <li>Airplanes worth owning or trading.</li>
        <li>Early stage companies doing neat things with health and wellness, marketplaces, and transportation.</li>
        <li>Air-cooled Porsches and other specialty cars and trucks.</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="cta cta-blue" href={url('/contact')}>Bring me a deal</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
